s Dell, Lenovo, Acer, HP, Asus e muito mais!', 307.44, 307.44, NULL, 'Computers & Accessories > Desktop & Laptop Components > Others', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-825a1-mr20ko02tvr594', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F801641954%2F19297809189', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
