l usá-lo EM Chuva Pesada por muito tempo e limpar a água a tempo após a chuva. 10. Fornecer duas bases Que pode ser adequado para duas bicicletas, e pode ser adequado para guidão diferente. 1000 Lumens Bicicleta Luz Dianteira BK105 1.Luz de bicicleta de alto brilho, 1000 brilhante para BK105 2. Sensor inteligente interno 3.2000 mAh Bateria recarregável de grande capacidade 4.Interruptor de cabo 5.120db Buzina Interior 6.O indicador da bateria 7.A concha de plástico 8.Quente. Resistente 9. Fornecer uma base Nota: 1. Como usar o modo inteligente do BK510, entre no modo de destaque de luz dupla, aguarde cerca de 45 segundos, quando a luz pisca, é entrar no modo de detecção de luz inteligente 2. Sobre o uso da luz traseira, você precisa colocar o papel na bateria da luz traseira e, em seguida, pressionar a luz da cauda para ligá-lo. ************************************************** 2021 New Arrival Bike Light Speaker Power Bank 3 IN 1 BK510 There are 9 Update Points for this Newest Version BK510 1.High brightness bicycle light, 1800 bright for BK510 There are L2 lamp beads inside, other sellers are T6, L2 is with greater brightness, ensuring riding more Safe and NO worries. 2. Inside smart sensor What Can automatically change brightness with outer light, which is more powerful and smarter. When the outside light is enough. It automatically decreases When the outer light is darkened. Brilliant automatically 3,4000 mAh Large capacity rechargeable battery What Can Keep One long to battery twenty hours under Low brightness. 4.Cable Switch Hands do not need to leave the guider, more Safe operation can still be carried out at high speed. 5.120db Horn Inside More effectively reminds pedestrians or vehicles On the road, ensuring a safer driving. 6.With the function of the Power Seat Cell phone can be charged IN an emergency When the phone is WITHOUT Power to walk long-distance, NO long-distance worries. 7.The battery indicator The battery''s level is displayed, the battery life is clear While knowing, and the riding rhythm can be more controlled. When the bicycle light is charging, the indicator also works. 8.Aluminum Alloy casing The head aluminum alloy casing ensures A heat dissipation More effective and durability, and will not be damaged Even if it is left dropped. 9.Waterproof design It is not recommended to use it IN Heavy Rain for a long time, and clean the water in time after rain. 10. Provide two bases Which can be suitable for two bikes, and can be suitable for different handlebars. 1000 Lumens Bike Front Light BK105 1.High brightness bicycle light, 1000 bright for BK105 2. Inside smart sensor 3,2000 mAh Large capacity rechargeable battery 4.Cable Switch 5.120db Horn Inside 6.The battery indicator 7.The plastic shell 8.Wat. Tough 9. Provide one base Note: 1. How to use the smart mode of BK510, please enter the dual-light highlight mode, wait for about 45 seconds, when the light flashes, it is to enter the intelligent light sensing mode 2. About the use of the tail light, you need to put the paper out the tail light battery, and then press the tail light to turn it on.', 125.98, 74.11, NULL, 'Sports & Outdoors > Sports & Outdoor Recreation Equipments > Cycling', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/59c234fd77eb8574560433c136ba19f4', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F428173977%2F7794103691', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
